# Phase 1: Layer 2 Compound Filter

## Overview
Build the 5-Year Compound Test that gates every opportunity BEFORE deep analysis. This is the highest-impact change — it prevents the pipeline from recommending freelance-tier opportunities that have no compound growth path.

## Requirements
- Functional: Score every opportunity on 5 compound dimensions. KILL/DOWNGRADE/PASS verdict.
- Non-functional: <2s execution per opportunity. Pure Python, no external deps.

## Architecture

```
Opportunity Input (from V16 archetype scanners)
    ↓
compound-filter.py (5 questions)
    ↓
Score: 0-5 (must score ≥3 to PASS)
    ↓
PASS → continue to V16 deep-reasoner
DOWNGRADE → tag as "bridge only" (Stair 1 max)
KILL → log reason, skip
```

### 5-Year Compound Test Questions

| # | Question | Score 1 | Score 0 |
|---|----------|---------|---------|
| 1 | Revenue recurring? | MRR/ARR/subscription | One-time project fee |
| 2 | Marginal cost decreases with scale? | Software/content/data | Linear labor cost |
| 3 | Moat after 12 months? | Data, brand, switching cost | Commodity, no lock-in |
| 4 | Network effect possible? | Users attract users | No network dynamic |
| 5 | Founder can step away 2 weeks? | Revenue continues | Revenue stops |

### Timing Score (bonus layer)

```python
timing_score = {
